5. RE-HOOK + FIX 2: a fresh re-hook line, then a second named step for the same problem with its own EXACT WORDS in quotes.
6. IF THAT DOESN'T WORK: one or two lines on what to do when it still happens (stay calm, same words, try again tomorrow).
7. CLOSING SUGGESTION: a warm nudge to try it, never a call to action ('Next time, try it once. Same words, every time.').

