- "subject": who is in the picture, exactly one of mom|baby|both|object|none — mom = the parent alone, baby = the child alone, both = the two together, object = a thing with nobody in it (tiny socks, a cold cup of coffee, the baby monitor glow), none = an empty place. Use 'both' on at most 4 lines in 10, and show no face (object, none, or a detail of hands) on at least 1 line in every 4.
